WEBVTT

00:30.713 --> 00:35.035
Headlights cut across the rain

00:38.416 --> 00:42.757
Wipers keep the beat on the windowpane

00:45.298 --> 00:54.021
Static on the radio fading in and out We're just

00:54.141 --> 00:57.983
shadows in the dashboard lights

01:01.871 --> 01:05.994
Driving in the dark, running on neon fumes

01:06.195 --> 01:10.038
Leaving all the ghosts in their empty rooms The

01:10.118 --> 01:17.103
city's just a map of glowing, faded lines But I'm

01:17.163 --> 01:22.968
safe right here, between your eyes and mine

01:24.168 --> 01:29.132
Midnight drivers, in the fading light

01:32.647 --> 01:37.569
The skyline's a promise cold and blue.

01:40.790 --> 01:47.372
I don't know this road, but I'm with you. The

01:47.532 --> 01:56.015
analog display is a steady green glow. Got no

01:56.115 --> 02:00.076
destination, just a place to go.

02:03.423 --> 02:07.945
Driving in the dark, running on neon fumes

02:08.245 --> 02:12.007
Leaving all the ghosts in their empty rooms This

02:12.067 --> 02:19.050
city's just a map of glowing faded lines But I'm

02:19.090 --> 02:24.372
safe right here, between your eyes and mine

02:26.113 --> 02:30.995
Midnight drivers, in the fading light

02:35.273 --> 02:43.465
Don't have to talk Don't have to say a thing The

02:43.626 --> 02:50.816
engine hums a rhythm The future's what we bring

03:14.406 --> 03:16.407
Thank you.

03:21.204 --> 03:25.327
Driving in the dark Running on neon fumes

03:25.648 --> 03:29.411
Leaving all the ghosts in their empty rooms The

03:29.491 --> 03:36.476
city's just a map of glowing Faded lines But I'm

03:36.516 --> 03:41.721
safe right here Between your eyes and mine

03:43.542 --> 03:48.426
Midnight drivers In the fading light

04:24.074 --> 04:24.441
you

